[Music]  after a great year in videogames we can  only expect to see even bigger and  better gaming experiences as we make our  way through 2020 so today we've rounded  up some of the most anticipated titles  that are coming to the PlayStation 4 and  PlayStation 5 this year to help you  decide what will join your collection  announced at the 2019 game awards  Gearbox's God fall as a third person  melee action RPG that is set to release  on the PlayStation 5 in this a RPG  players can choose to play solo or in  groups up to three via multiplayer co-op  not much else has been revealed other  than a playstation blog post describing  some of its all new looter slasher  mechanics with plans for a holiday 2020  release playstation also says to look  out for more information about God fall  coming this spring based on a  free-to-play mobile RPG granblue fantasy  vs. utilizes the same universe and its  characters and throws him into a 2d  fighting game developed by Arc System  Works this will be the series first  outing onto home consoles and its first  appearance in North America since the  original III 2019 announcement eleven  characters have been announced with more  coming to the roster via future DLC  brand blue Fantasy Versus comes to ps4  on February 6th  throughout 2019 you may have caught wind  of a little creative game called dreams  during its early access period in 2019  fans began creating their very own video  games as well as remaking classics such  as the original Resident Evil that's  because dreams allows you to create a  game animated movie and soundtrack from  the ground up using an extensive Creator  tool kit after overwhelmingly positive  feedback from the early access build  dreams developer Media Molecule  announced up a game is releasing on  February 14th coming exclusively to the  PSV Arc  you'll be able to suit up as one of  Earth's Mightiest Heroes in this new and  original Iron Man adventure face off  against an anti corporate hacker who's  determined to topple Starks Empire by  using a vast assortment of customized  armor and abilities the game's  announcement trailer shows how your VR  headset can imitate Tony's in helmet UI  as you fly through the atmosphere  utilizing Iron Man's iconic arsenal and  virtual reality players will fight to  defend starts various locations and no  doubt save the world  Ironman VR is set to be released on  February 28th after decades of waiting  Final Fantasy 7 remake is coming to the  ps4 the iconic Square Enix RPG has had  its fair share of rumors surrounding a  remake since the early 2000s when  announcements were made for the ps2  however the project went cold and it  wasn't until III 2015 where the reveal  trailer announced the official ground-up  remake using the Unreal 4 engine Square  Enix also announced an official release  date of March 3rd 2020 which is 23 years  after the original release and from what  we've seen so far it's looking to be  worth the wait only a year after the  release of Team ninjas Neil in 2017 a  sequel was announced at e3 2018 while  it's a sequel in name it will actually  take place before the events of the  first game and like the previous games  re-release phase a playable demo was  released in 2019 which showed off new  enemies yokai powers and the ability to  customize your own protagonist based on  official survey results of the demo it  seems fans are quite excited about an  upcoming sequel team ninjas creative  director Tom Lee assured fans that all  feedback was well received and more  improvements will be made so prepare  your thumbs for more big bosses evil  spirits and even  some rolling cats because neo2 comes to  ps4 on March 13th  previously released only in Japan  personify royal is the complete and  enhanced edition of the 2016 original  this updated version adds ps4 pro  supported 20 new music tracks a new  phantom thief an all-new 3rd semester  and much more  much like persona 4 golden is the  complete package for both newcomers and  veterans of the original game and if you  want to go all-out a phantom thief's  collector's edition was announced the  bundle includes a dynamic ps4 a themed  joker mask art book soundtrack and a  steelbook case personify royal launches  on March 31st hunt or be hunted the  choice is yours predator hunting grounds  is an immersive asymmetrical shooter  coming exclusively to the ps4 on April  24th your mission as the predator is  simple stock and study the Warriors in  the forest as you take them down one by  one while collecting a trophy for each  one in the process with a variety of  classes weapons and tech you'll be  looking for only the best of the best to  engage with your mission as the prey  however is a little bit more complicated  although you'll be playing as a member  of an elite fireteam your objectives in  the forest will be challenging enough  without considering the predator lurking  in the shadows you'll have to coordinate  and strategize your way to safety  without falling prey to the hunter good  luck so 5 years after the events of its  predecessor the Last of Us part 2  follows an older Ellie and Joel who have  finally found a life of peace among a  thriving community of survivors that is  until a violent event forces Ellie to  embark on a new journey and search for  vengeance justice and closure on May  29th you can experience this beautiful  but dangerous world for yourself and  thanks to the newest iteration of the  Naughty Dog Engine the characters and  world are more realistic and  meticulously detailed than ever before  at Paris games week 2017 Sucker Punch  Games announced their next project  following the successful infamous series  ghosts of Tsushima is a stealth action  adventure set in the 12th 70s you play  as Jin sekai one of the remaining  samurai defending the island of Tsushima  against the invasion of the Mongol  Empire since its announcement trailers  have revealed the artistic combats  and sprawling open world environment  Costa Tsushima will be launching this  summer from the developers of observe  the pathless is a single player  atmospheric adventure that will take you  through a world plagued by darkness  explore a mysterious curse island with  your eco companion as you bound  acrobatically through dense forests to  hunt prey and discover ancient ruins as  a graceful hunter moving through this  mystical world your skills and abilities  would be the key to conquering the  dangerous spirits lurking in the woods  with the unique take on the design of  archery intuitive gameplay and a  captivating atmosphere the pathless is  looking to hit the bull's eye when it  launches on ps4 this year yakuza returns  in 2020 with a fresh face and the  accuser like a dragon you play as  Ichiban cazuca a member of the Tojo  clans Arakawa family who serves 18 years  in prison after trying to work his way  up the ranks when released from prison  he ends up in Yokohama far from home in  a place where no one remembers him to  celebrate the series 15 anniversary a  combat overhaul has been introduced  combining its popular brawler elements  with a new turn-based battle system the  accuser like a dragon launches in Japan  on January 16th and worldwide later this  year which one of these games are you  looking forward to the most let us know  in the comments below and be sure to  LIKE and subscribe so you can catch all  of our future videos see you next time  you  [Music]

